# REAL division by zero. Implementation-defined: ed.3 annex E / ed.2 annex
# E list division by zero among the errors with implementer-specific
# handling; a runtime following IEC 60559 returns +inf, -inf and NaN
# without stopping. The records are what IronPLC does.
period_ms: 100
program: main
inputs: x y
outputs: q
status: implementation-defined
reference: IEC 61131-3 ed.3 annex E (division by zero)
---
0 x=1.0 y=2.0  => q=0.5
1 x=1.0 y=0.0  => q=inf
2 x=-1.0 y=0.0 => q=-inf
3 x=0.0 y=0.0  => q=nan
4 x=1.0 y=2.0  => q=0.5
